1 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 30% of normal in August to September and 45% in September to October. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids shows 43% for January to February and 164% for March to April. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 24783 at 63%.</p>"}
